translated_text:
Article 40

1. Achievement of KTP prevention involving parties in the Regency Area as referred to in Article 37 letter a is measured by criteria.
2. Criteria for achievement of KTP prevention as referred to in paragraph (1) consist of:a. compliance with implementation of policies regarding KTP prevention;
b. impact of implementation of programs, activities, and budget regarding KTP prevention;
c. impact of communication, information, and education activities regarding KTP prevention;
